---
---

<section class="team">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="team-header">
      <span class="duo-badge duo-badge-warm">👥 Tim Kami</span>
      <h2>Tim Kami</h2>
      <p>Orang-orang di balik Kulineria</p>
    </div>

    <div class="team-grid">
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-avatar">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="38" fill="#FFFDF7" stroke="#C49A6E" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="40" cy="32" r="14" fill="#C49A6E"/>
            <ellipse cx="40" cy="62" rx="20" ry="16" fill="#C49A6E"/>
            <circle cx="34" cy="28" r="2.5" fill="#3C2A1E"/>
            <circle cx="46" cy="28" r="2.5" fill="#3C2A1E"/>
            <path d="M 36 36 Q 40 40 44 36" fill="none" stroke="#3C2A1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <rect x="28" y="58" width="24" height="4" rx="2" fill="#3C2A1E" opacity="0.1"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Nara</h3>
        <p class="team-role">Pemandu Kuliner</p>
        <p class="team-bio">Teman digitalmu menjelajahi Nusantara. Nara tahu setiap hidangan, setiap cerita, dan setiap bahan rahasia.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-avatar">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="38" fill="#FFFDF7" stroke="#D4A76A" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="40" cy="32" r="14" fill="#D4A76A"/>
            <ellipse cx="40" cy="62" rx="20" ry="16" fill="#D4A76A"/>
            <circle cx="34" cy="28" r="2.5" fill="#3C2A1E"/>
            <circle cx="46" cy="28" r="2.5" fill="#3C2A1E"/>
            <path d="M 36 36 Q 40 40 44 36" fill="none" stroke="#3C2A1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Chef Arsip</h3>
        <p class="team-role">Kurator Resep</p>
        <p class="team-bio">Kumpulan resep tradisional yang dikumpulkan dari juru masak lokal, nenek-nenek, dan sejarawan kuliner di seluruh Indonesia.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-avatar">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="38" fill="#FFFDF7" stroke="#C4815E" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="40" cy="32" r="14" fill="#C4815E"/>
            <ellipse cx="40" cy="62" rx="20" ry="16" fill="#C4815E"/>
            <circle cx="34" cy="28" r="2.5" fill="#3C2A1E"/>
            <circle cx="46" cy="28" r="2.5" fill="#3C2A1E"/>
            <path d="M 36 36 Q 40 40 44 36" fill="none" stroke="#3C2A1E" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Penjelajah Peta</h3>
        <p class="team-role">Geografi & Data</p>
        <p class="team-bio">Menghubungkan hidangan dengan asal-usulnya. Setiap penanda di peta menceritakan kisah tentang tempat, orang, dan rasa.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .team {
    padding: var(--sp-12) 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .team { padding: var(--sp-20) 0; }
  }

  .team-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-10);
  }
  .team-header h2 {
    font-family: var(--ff-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-2xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--c-text-1);
    margin-top: var(--sp-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-2);
  }
  .team-header p {
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    color: var(--c-text-2);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .team-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-5);
  }
  @media (min-width: 480px) {
    .team-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .team-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  }

  .team-card {
    padding: var(--sp-8);
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border: var(--duo-stroke) solid var(--duo-stroke-color);
    border-radius: var(--r-2xl);
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.2s var(--ease-bounce);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--c-brand-caramel-bg);
  }
  .team-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--c-accent-soft);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 0 var(--c-brand-caramel-bg);
  }

  .team-avatar {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--sp-4);
  }
  .team-avatar svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .team-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--ff-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--c-text-1);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-1);
  }

  .team-role {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: var(--c-accent);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .team-bio {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--c-text-2);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
